{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02608","headline":"古意六首 二 · 王绩","name":"古意六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹生大夏谿，苍苍富奇质。\n绿叶吟风劲，翠茎犯霄密。\n霜霰封其柯，鵷鸾食其实。\n宁知轩辕後，更有伶伦出。\n刀斧俄见寻，根株坐相失。\n裁爲十二管，吹作雄雌律。\n有用虽自伤，无心复招疾。\n不如山上草，离离保终吉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02608.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02608","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}